    defined in libc++abi, but it is also possible to define them in libc++, in
diff --git a/llvm-project/libcxxabi/lib/emulated-tls.exp b/llvm-project/libcxxabi/lib/emulated-tls.exp
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..7572e2b6
--- /dev/null
